{"parse":{"title":"11th Sikkim Assembly","revid":1353427265,"text":"<div><div><h2>Members of Legislative Assembly</h2></div>\n<p>The <b>Eleventh</b> assembly was elected in <a href=\"/wiki/2024_Sikkim_Legislative_Assembly_election\" title=\"2024 Sikkim Legislative Assembly election\">2024 Sikkim Legislative Assembly election</a>. The current members are listed below: \n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>District\n</th>\n<th>No.\n</th>\n<th>Constituency\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Party\n</th>\n<th>Remarks\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gyalshing_district\" title=\"Gyalshing district\">Gyalshing</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Yoksam%E2%80%93Tashiding_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Yoksam–Tashiding Assembly constituency\">Yoksam–Tashiding</a> (BL)\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tshering_Thendup_Bhutia\" title=\"Tshering Thendup Bhutia\">Tshering Thendup Bhutia</a>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"34\" data-sort-value=\"Sikkim Krantikari Morcha\">\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"34\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sikkim_Krantikari_Morcha\" title=\"Sikkim Krantikari Morcha\">Sikkim Krantikari Morcha</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Yangthang_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Yangthang Assembly constituency\">Yangthang</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bhim_Hang_Limboo\" title=\"Bhim Hang Limboo\">Bhim Hang Limboo</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Maneybong%E2%80%93Dentam_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Maneybong–Dentam Assembly constituency\">Maneybong–Dentam</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sudesh_Kumar_Subba\" title=\"Sudesh Kumar Subba\">Sudesh Kumar Subba</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gyalshing%E2%80%93Barnyak_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Gyalshing–Barnyak Assembly constituency\">Gyalshing–Barnyak</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lok_Nath_Sharma\" title=\"Lok Nath Sharma\">Lok Nath Sharma</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><a h