ia\">Rikshal Dorjee Bhutia</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Poklok%E2%80%93Kamrang_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Poklok–Kamrang Assembly constituency\">Poklok–Kamrang</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bhoj_Raj_Rai\" title=\"Bhoj Raj Rai\">Bhoj Raj Rai</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">11\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Namchi%E2%80%93Singhithang_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Namchi–Singhithang Assembly constituency\">Namchi–Singhithang</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Krishna_Kumari_Rai\" title=\"Krishna Kumari Rai\">Krishna Kumari Rai</a>\n</td>\n<td>Resigned on 13 June 2024<sup><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span>&#91;</span>4<span>&#93;</span></a></sup><sup><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span>&#91;</span>5<span>&#93;</span></a></sup><sup><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span>&#91;</span>6<span>&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Satish_Chandra_Rai_(politician)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Satish Chandra Rai (politician)\">Satish Chandra Rai</a></td>\n<td>Elected unopposed in <a href=\"/wiki/2024_elections_in_India#Sikkim\" title=\"2024 elections in India\">2024 by-election</a><sup><a href=\"#cite_note-2024_Sikkim_by-election_result-3\"><span>&#91;</span>3<span>&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Melli_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Melli Assembly constituency\">Melli</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nar_Bahadur_Pradhan\" title=\"Nar Bahadur Pradhan\">Nar Bahadur Pradhan</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Namthang%E2%80%93Rateypani_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Namthang–Rateypani Assembly constituency\">Namthang–Rateypani</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjit_Kharel\" title=\"Sanjit Kharel\">Sanjit Kharel</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Temi%E2%80%93Namphing_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Temi–Namphing Assembly constituency\">Temi–Namphing</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/